```lean
/-- A state of a C*-algebra: a unital positive continuous functional. -/
def IsState {A : Type} [CStarAlgebra A] (ω : A →L[ℂ] ℂ) : Prop :=
  ω 1 = 1 ∧ ∀ x, 0 ≤ ω (star x * x)
```

